# Git text

Commit titles and PR summaries are UTF-8. Use plain punctuation or emoji. Do not use curly quotes, ellipsis characters, or em dashes.

Write PR bodies with `Path.write_text` and `gh pr create --body-file`. Never put markdown backticks in a PowerShell string: `` `a `` is BEL and GitHub shows it as a replacement character.

Origin `docs/` keep their historical punctuation; do not "ASCII-ify" them in drive-by edits.
